  "answer": "In edit mode the player's controls do not show: opacity 0, no pointer events, so Settings can't be pressed there. In preview it can. Settings opens a menu 164 by 48.4, right edge 1244.8, its bottom 12 above the button, with one row, Speed Normal. Speed swaps it for a menu 160 by 275.1 with a back row and seven options, 32.4 high: 0.5x, 0.75x, Normal (checked), 1.25x, 1.5x, 1.75x, 2x. Escape closes it. The controls hide while the video plays and show when it's paused or ended; the clip is 7 seconds long.",
